    "readmeSummary": "## Flipkart Product Scraper\n\nScrapes Flipkart search-result pages to extract detailed product information for price monitoring, cataloging, competition analysis, and e-commerce analytics. The Actor collects real-time pricing and discount data, product titles and brand metadata, full media assets (images and videos), textual descriptions, category and subcategory taxonomy, product flags (wishlist/chat/offer indicators), buyability/availability status, and embedded product analytics; records include numeric pricing values, discount amounts, media URLs, categorical labels, boolean flags and timestamps. Built for high-throughput scraping with proxy support and anti-blocking measures, it processes multiple search pages and returns structured product records optimized for full-text and semantic search.\n\n## Use cases\n\n- Price monitoring and tracking  \n- Market research and analysis  \n- Competition monitoring  \n- Product catalog building  \n- Inventory tracking  \n- E-commerce analytics",
